SPECIAL EVENT READINESS REVIEW
To: {event_permit_coordinator_name}
Decide whether {event_organizer}'s event is ready under the six scoped checks: liability insurance, emergency action plan, food service, alcohol service, amplified sound and temporary structures. Record exactly one outcome: resolve_insurance, resolve_emergency_plan, resolve_food, resolve_alcohol, resolve_sound, resolve_structures, or ready, and justify it with the facts you relied on.
